                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b62876e9-a525-4848-b677-95dbb34a8ae5",
                                "sense_id": "32675005-57db-3db8-a590-fec4b37a017a",
                                "text": "Пя́тый и после́дний обита́тель пала́ты № 6 — мещани́н, служи́вший когда́-то сортиро́вщиком на по́чте, ма́ленький, худоща́вый блонди́н с до́брым, но не́сколько лука́вым лицо́м.",
                                "translation": "The fifth and last inhabitant of Ward No. 6 is a man of the artisan class who had once been a sorter in the post office, a thinnish, fair little man with a good-natured but rather sly face.",
                                "english": "The fifth and last inhabitant of Ward No. 6 is a man of the artisan class who had once been a sorter in the post office, a thinnish, fair little man with a good-natured but rather sly face."
